# Document templates (Word / Excel / PowerPoint)

> **Mirror only.** SSOT: MCP `DOCUMENT_TEMPLATES` in `build_server_instructions`.

1. Clone from `.config/template/` when valid: `Word Template.docx`, `Excel Template.xlsx`, `PowerPoint Template.pptx`.
2. Clear body/slides only; keep header/footer/logo/styles.
3. Styles: Title (or H1), H1–H3, Normal. Template dir **read-only**.
4. Write under `data/{profile}/{env}/exports/`. Use `branded_documents` helpers.
5. Analytical Word: 1–3 Mermaid `diagrams` via local `mmdc` (no Kroki); notes with `##`/bullets.
6. See `.config/template/README.md`.
